From: =?UTF-8?q?Juan=20Manuel=20L=C3=B3pez=20Carrillo?=
 <juanmanuellopezcarrillo@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:20:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 143/143] config: sync opi4a_blindboot_defconfig with the
 shipped configuration

The kernel options added for v0.5 (built-in NVMe, the nftables bridge
family, all squashfs decompressors and xattrs, exFAT, NTFS3, UTF-8 NLS,
built-in F2FS) went into the .config the images are built from, but not
into the versioned defconfig. Regenerate it with 'make savedefconfig'
from that .config, so that building from this series gives exactly the
configuration of the released images.

Co-Authored-By: AI Agent
---
 arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig | 17 +++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig
index cad6e1b90..e873fbf15 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig
@@ -101,6 +101,7 @@ CONFIG_NFT_LIMIT=m
 CONFIG_NFT_MASQ=m
 CONFIG_NFT_REDIR=m
 CONFIG_NFT_NAT=m
+CONFIG_NFT_REJECT=m
 CONFIG_NFT_COMPAT=m
 CONFIG_NETFILTER_XTABLES_LEGACY=y
 CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MARK=m
@@ -118,6 +119,10 @@ CONFIG_NFT_FIB_IPV6=m
 CONFIG_IP6_NF_IPTABLES=m
 CONFIG_IP6_NF_NAT=m
 CONFIG_IP6_NF_TARGET_MASQUERADE=m
+CONFIG_NF_TABLES_BRIDGE=m
+CONFIG_NFT_BRIDGE_META=m
+CONFIG_NFT_BRIDGE_REJECT=m
+CONFIG_NF_CONNTRACK_BRIDGE=m
 CONFIG_BRIDGE=m
 CONFIG_BRIDGE_VLAN_FILTERING=y
 CONFIG_NET_DSA=m
@@ -239,7 +244,7 @@ CONFIG_ZRAM_BACKEND_LZO=y
 CONFIG_ZRAM_DEF_COMP_ZSTD=y
 CONFIG_BLK_DEV_LOOP=y
 CONFIG_BLK_DEV_NBD=m
-CONFIG_BLK_DEV_NVME=m
+CONFIG_BLK_DEV_NVME=y
 CONFIG_SRAM=y
 CONFIG_PCI_ENDPOINT_TEST=m
 CONFIG_EEPROM_AT24=m
@@ -1015,7 +1020,7 @@ CONFIG_EXT4_FS_POSIX_ACL=y
 CONFIG_EXT4_FS_SECURITY=y
 CONFIG_BTRFS_FS=m
 CONFIG_BTRFS_FS_POSIX_ACL=y
-CONFIG_F2FS_FS=m
+CONFIG_F2FS_FS=y
 CONFIG_F2FS_FS_COMPRESSION=y
 CONFIG_FANOTIFY=y
 CONFIG_FANOTIFY_ACCESS_PERMISSIONS=y
@@ -1025,11 +1030,18 @@ CONFIG_FUSE_FS=m
 CONFIG_CUSE=m
 CONFIG_OVERLAY_FS=m
 CONFIG_VFAT_FS=y
+CONFIG_EXFAT_FS=m
+CONFIG_NTFS3_FS=m
 CONFIG_TMPFS_POSIX_ACL=y
 CONFIG_HUGETLBFS=y
 CONFIG_EFIVAR_FS=y
 CONFIG_UBIFS_FS=m
 CONFIG_SQUASHFS=y
+CONFIG_SQUASHFS_XATTR=y
+CONFIG_SQUASHFS_LZ4=y
+CONFIG_SQUASHFS_LZO=y
+CONFIG_SQUASHFS_XZ=y
+CONFIG_SQUASHFS_ZSTD=y
 CONFIG_PSTORE_RAM=m
 CONFIG_NFS_FS=y
 CONFIG_NFS_V4=y
@@ -1039,6 +1051,7 @@ CONFIG_ROOT_NFS=y
 CONFIG_9P_FS=y
 CONFIG_NLS_CODEPAGE_437=y
 CONFIG_NLS_ISO8859_1=y
+CONFIG_NLS_UTF8=m
 CONFIG_SECURITY=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_USER=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_BENCHMARK=m
